<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Holy Word</h1>
<p>Sphere: Divine Sphere
Class: Healer (guild level 90), Paladin (guild level 90)
Mana: 15
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast holy word &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast holy word</a>   (at whoever you are fighting)
</pre>
<p>A holy word that wounds those who lean to evil. Any target whose alignment 
is below 0 can be struck, even a neutral who leans to evil; the truly evil 
are struck harder still. On anyone of alignment 0 or above, nothing 
happens. The 
better your divine power and your skill in the spell, the more it hurts.
</p><p>It hurts most through clothes and least through plate, which takes about 
40% less, and a weak cast does nothing to plate at all. A shield can block 
it. Casting it is an attack and starts a fight. It can be cast while 
fighting. It is also found on scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Holy Touch</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Holy Grasp</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Holy Shout</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Dispel Evil</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Divine Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>